      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，小女孩寄了一封信来。\n说手术已经顺利结束，要把手镜还给好歌剧。\n然后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5384a9d1869107bca34969452108bb741bc60c0adecd9a486f1f277272e423",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
