      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上面还写着\n“下次会先穿漂亮的洋装，再拿去给你哦”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e19a9a9ca845d13e0dd264276ad9bf3229d381bb6f38ee0c2615e9b47edc5e",
