      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯，当然了！你的眼泪代表了不甘心与后悔！\n是希望向前迈进之人流下的眼泪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2271a1dc12a5e91048d1d254f676b1bc35b90dbc27d57bf717f8a1d85c1e02df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
